stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_parse: parse request List[DataColumnsByRootIdentifier]
    q_parse --> q_compute_min: min_epoch = max(current_epoch - MIN_EPOCHS, FULU_FORK_EPOCH)
    q_compute_min --> q_iter_ids: for identifier in request
    q_iter_ids --> q_check_epoch: check block_root epoch >= min_epoch
    q_check_epoch --> q_skip: epoch < min_epoch / ResourceUnavailable or skip
    q_check_epoch --> q_lookup_block: epoch >= min_epoch
    q_lookup_block --> q_iter_ids: block not found / skip
    q_lookup_block --> q_iter_cols: block found
    q_iter_cols --> q_check_gossip: for column_index in identifier.columns
    q_check_gossip --> q_send: sidecar passes gossip validation
    q_check_gossip --> q_iter_cols: sidecar fails validation / skip
    q_send --> q_check_max: send response_chunk with DataColumnSidecar
    q_check_max --> q_iter_cols: total < MAX_REQUEST_DATA_COLUMN_SIDECARS
    q_check_max --> [*]: total >= MAX_REQUEST_DATA_COLUMN_SIDECARS / done
    q_iter_cols --> q_iter_ids: all columns for identifier sent
    q_iter_ids --> [*]: all identifiers processed
    q_skip --> q_iter_ids
